sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as OutboxRelayService (1 s)
  participant DB as order_db
  participant K as Redpanda
  W->>DB: claimOutboxBatch(50): PENDING or lease-expired PROCESSING,<br/>oldest unpublished per aggregate, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED → PROCESSING, lease 60 s
  loop each claimed event, in order
    W->>K: send orders.events (key = aggregateId, idempotent producer, acks = all)
  end
  alt all sent
    W->>DB: markOutboxPublished
  else send fails
    W->>DB: markOutboxFailed → PENDING, retry_count + 1, last_error
  end
